    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A beautifully presented home that perfectly combines modern finishes and contemporary style with the charm and character of the original property. Throughout the home, there is a wonderful blend of tasteful upgrades and retained original features, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere. To the rear, ''Saint Kevin's'' benefits from a mature, fully private west-facing garden, offering a wonderful outdoor space that enjoys plenty of sunshine throughout the afternoon and evening. Ideally positioned on the south side of Drogheda, the property enjoys a highly convenient location close to a host of local amenities, including schools, shops, bus and train services. The M1 motorway is also easily accessible by car, providing excellent connectivity to Dublin and surrounding areas. This is a well-located and characterful home that offers both privacy and convenience. Viewing Is Highly Advised.\n\nAMV 395,000 For Sale by Private Treaty\n\nFeatures\n3 Bedroom Semi-Detached House\nExtends to c. 124 sq.m (c. 1334 sq.ft)\nCentral Location \nG-F-C-H\nOpen Fire x 4 \nWest Facing Rear Garden\nPrivate Rear Orientation\nMature Planting & Growth\nSide Garage Roller Shutter\nOff Street Parking\nFully Alarmed\n\nAccommodation Includes\nEntrance Hallway\nReception Room (3.78m x 3.91m) \nLounge(3.90m x 4.22m)\nKitchen / Dining(2.37m x 4.69m)\n (1.84m x 1.72m)\nSun Room(1.76m x 3.67m)\nShower Room / WC(1.92m x 2.10m)\nGarage (4.58m x 2.93m)\n\n1st Floor\nLanding\nBedroom 1(4.30m x 3.90m)\nBedroom 2(3.82m x 3.90m)\nBedroom 3(2.60m x 2.78m)\nMain Bathroom(1.58m x 2.42m)\n\nViewing Details\nStrictly by Appointment with the Sole Selling Agent.\n"
      },
